{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Discount Stack 是一款專門處理連續折扣的計算工具，適合經常在購物旺季、會員優惠或商場推廣中比價的用戶。先減 30% 再減 20% 並不等於減 50%，此 App 會按剩餘價格逐層計算兩次百分比折扣，再視需要加上稅項，得出預計應付金額。現由原價 US $0.99 改為<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-121.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>連續折扣與稅項一次算清</h2>\n<p>計算結果可命名儲存，方便日後翻查。用家能搜尋歷史紀錄、重新開啟舊有計算，調整數值後再算一次，比較不同折扣組合的實際差距。App 亦允許獨立切換語言、數字樣式與貨幣，貨幣切換只改變顯示單位，不會換算匯率。全程無需註冊帳號，計算紀錄只保留在裝置內。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-384-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-385-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-386-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-387-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-388-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Discount Stack</li><li>應用類別：Shopping</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/discount-stack/id6802308517?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:02:15.783850+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:43:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:15.654953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:59:10.781573+00:00","content_hash":"7a6e9f59f253113a0098b2732941b6ba4a64e4fb940db3b5e1dd14d5b54fa753","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:02:15.783850+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}